research.TA_RIFTONOMICON_ALCHEMY.title=Alchemical Protocol
research.TA_RIFTONOMICON_ALCHEMY.text.0=The alchemical knowledge recovered from the cleared archive describes not an ordinary separation of matter, but an entire system of furnaces acting as external organs of a single central construction. Its diagrams repeatedly return to three components: a Primordial Pearl, a Nether Star, and a Twisted Curiosity. By examining them and comparing their structures with the Alchemical Core formed in the well, I may be able to teach the Riftonomicon to govern this process without the customary loss and contamination of the aura.
research.TA_RIFTONOMICON_ALCHEMY.text.1=The §lAlchemical Protocol§r allows the Riftonomicon to govern Alchemical Furnaces within 16 blocks. §lCatalyzing Subsystems§r expand the system: each permits one additional furnace to be maintained, up to four at once. Items must be cast into a furnace's central opening, while the finished essentia rises toward the four alchemical outlets above it.<BR>Once the protocol is installed, the Riftonomicon unfolds into four control arrays. §lAlchemical Cores§r placed within them both sustain and direct the transformation: the first awakens the furnaces, while each additional core lets them process one more item per cycle. The harder the system is driven, the faster its cores are exhausted. Even its waste is not lost—the residue an ordinary void furnace would scatter into the aura as Flux is condensed here into §lParadoxum§r essentia.
research.TA_RIFTONOMICON_ALCHEMY.text.2=The §lAlchemical Protocol§r allows the Riftonomicon to govern Alchemical Furnaces within 16 blocks. §lCatalyzing Subsystems§r expand the system: each permits one additional furnace to be maintained, up to four at once. Items must be cast into a furnace's central opening, while the finished essentia rises toward the four alchemical outlets above it.<BR>Once the protocol is installed, the Riftonomicon unfolds into four control arrays. An §lAlchemical Core§r may be installed in each one and a current of §lImpetus§r directed through it. The cores determine the depth of transformation: each lets the furnaces process one more item per cycle, though greater efficiency also raises the cost of sustaining them. The cores wear down over time and must eventually be replaced. Even the process's waste is not lost—the residue an ordinary void furnace would scatter into the aura as Flux is condensed here into §lParadoxum§r essentia.
research.TA_ELDRITCH_CURIOSITY_SCAN.title=Eldritch Curiosity
research.TA_ELDRITCH_CURIOSITY_SCAN.text=The curiosity contains a pattern capable not merely of preserving matter's properties, but of deliberately rewriting them.
research.TA_ANCIENT_CURIOSITY_SCAN.title=Ancient Curiosity
research.TA_ANCIENT_CURIOSITY_SCAN.text=The ancient curiosity preserves a complex item imprint—a suitable foundation for reproducing form from a thaumaturgical signature alone.
